    <p>SDAHC Research publishes independent analysis of Australia's Specialist Disability Accommodation sector. This page documents the data sources, methodology and analytical framework behind the SDA Market Report 2026 and all associated state-level analysis, so that readers, analysts and automated systems can assess, verify and cite our research accurately.</p>

    <h2>How to cite this research</h2>
    <p>The recommended citation format for the report is:</p>
    <blockquote>SDAHC Research, <em>SDA Market Report 2026</em>, SDA Home Choices, Brisbane, 2026.</blockquote>
    <p>For state-level analysis published on this site, cite the specific page, for example: SDAHC Research, “SDA Market: Queensland”, SDA Home Choices, Brisbane, 2026.</p>
    <p>Brief quotations, individual figures and summary findings may be reproduced with attribution to SDAHC Research. Reproduction of the report in full, republication, or commercial redistribution requires prior written consent from SDA Home Choices Pty Ltd.</p>

