    <h2>Our approach</h2>
    <p>This research synthesises public NDIS data with transaction, valuation and sector intelligence. Public data shows market size, supply, participant numbers and funding commitments. Commercial evidence helps interpret what those figures mean for value, vacancy risk, provider depth, liquidity and investor decision-making.</p>
    <p>Government data is necessary. Commercial interpretation is what this research adds.</p>

